      "writtenOn": "2014-01-06T15:46:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In our case, we have a strong suspicion that the other application is the gradle daemon (which casual users of the IDE may not even be aware exists, since they didn\u0027t manually start it). Should we add a clue about this? If we\u0027re planning to suggest this patch to JetBrains, then clearly it doesn\u0027t belong here, but at least in the Studio fork I think that will benefit many users.",
      "revId": "0cf946133de47a9d25f45b9ac7e4ce6b3d2a0e53",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
